PRETABLE_5 -- mvme187memcoob detector, test-variant table 5 (repair 5, 206 rows).  Written BEFORE table 5 runs (this file's
mtime precedes table5/SCORES.txt).  Instrument: table5/probe206_frozen.py (copied from regress/mvme187_memc_probe.py after the
repair-5 edits; base on the build tree 206/206, r5_20261105/base206/probe_base206.out).  Baseline: GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/
dev_mvme187.c (== det_20261104/dev_mvme187.c.fix2: repair 5 changed the probe and the gate, not the device).  Legs first, in the
same clone: base, HEAD (det_20261104/dev_mvme187.c.HEAD), three null media.  Rows: 206.

METHOD.  Every prediction marked `exact` is the probe's own verdict on a modelled device: the frozen probe is executed with its
gxemul replaced by a fake that decodes its m88k words and runs them against DEVICE_ACCESS(mvme187_memc) as written in the fix
with the variant's statement inserted at its position (memc_variants_5.py, class Device).  Calibration: `memc_variants_5.py
check4` replays table 4's frozen 148-row instrument through the same model for the HEAD leg, the null media, B1/B2 and every
table-4 variant the model expresses (55 of 112) and compares with table 4's measured red sets (T5_PREP.md records the result).
Predictions marked `at least` are table 4's MEASURED red sets for the variants the model does not express (exits, faults, the
indexed read, masks, casts, swaps, widths: their mechanisms are not statements of L), minus the ten rows repair 5 re-wanted
(R5_lines, R5_pc, R7_pc, R9_lines, R9_pc, R12_pc, R13_lines, R13_pc, R15_lines, R15_pc): those rows are not carried.

THE DENOMINATOR (CONS_MYTHOS_local.md section 3, walked cell by cell -- see the module docstring for the alphabet):
  cells walked: 37974 = latch statements 16750 + keep statements 20100 + gated latch sets/tests 912 + gated notice predicates 212
  positions 11 (the ruling's ten plus ME, the memconf arm's after-block twin of DA); gates per position: 81 conjunctions over
  {W, C, M, D} (incl. always) + 64 idata-bit tests (all positions) + 16 offset-bit tests (H, DT, DB, DA, TL).
  VACUOUS (semantically no-op at the position; not mutants, not built): 6676
  non-vacuous cells: 31298.  Predicted RED: 26999 cells in 2686 distinct observable traces -> 2798 BUILT (one per trace, plus 112
  promoted so that every statement and every gate form is compiled at least once); the other 24201 RED cells are EQUIV:
  the same observable trace as their representative on every probe access (listed under it).
  Predicted GREEN (the fix's trace): 4299 cells in 1600 (statement, deviation-set) groups -> 665 BUILT: one per group for
  UNFIRED and UNOBSERVED, one per statement for NOCHANGE: NOCHANGE 148, UNFIRED 106, UNOBSERVED 411.
  UNFIRED = no probe access satisfies the gate at that position; UNOBSERVED = the statement fired and changed the state but
  no later access read it back; NOCHANGE = fired, state unchanged (probe-equivalent: the ruling's disclosed `^= idata` into
  a set latch and kin).  UNFIRED and UNOBSERVED are predicted SURVIVORS of the 206 rows inside the denominator.

